<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Austereo half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Austereo half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   17.15   vs  15.45</p>
<p>    Net profit			   17.15   vs  15.45</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    4.0    vs   4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Austereo Ltd is a radio station operator and is about 53 percent owned by Village Roadshow Ltd.</p>
</text>
